._*
.DS_Store
portal/question-bank-source/

# Student data must never reach a public repo — this one is also the
# GitHub Pages source for morettitutoring.com, so anything committed here
# is served as plain text to anyone who asks for it. owen_payload.json
# (a named student's full diagnostic record) was public for that reason.
*payload*.json
*_export.json
*.csv

# Local Apps Script working copies. The authoritative source lives in the
# Apps Script project; these are reference copies only and are served
# publicly if committed. See the ADMIN_KEY comment in Code.gs.
portal/*.gs

# Internal deployment/architecture notes. These name the exact endpoints
# and describe which gates are and are not live — not something to serve
# publicly, especially while any of it is still unpatched.
portal/AUTH_INTEGRATION.md
portal/DEPLOYMENT.md

# Working notes. Kept out of the published site: this repo IS the site,
# so anything tracked here is served at morettitutoring.com/<path>.
HANDOFF_*.md
